/T (How to create a Repository \(Repo\): A "repository" is just a fancy word for a project folder. To create one, go to GitHub, click the + icon in the top right corner, select New repository, give it a name, check the box that says "Add a README file", and click Create repository. )
/E (How to create a Repository \(Repo\): A "repository" is just a fancy word for a project folder. To create one, go to GitHub, click the + icon in the top right corner, select New repository, give it a name, check the box that says "Add a README file", and click Create repository. )
